OL,3,GNEWSAFatal bungalow fire ruled         
OL,4,Aaccidental                             
OL,6,FInvestigators have concluded a fire    
OL,7,Fthat killed a man at a bungalow in     
OL,8,FHeanor was started accidentally.       
OL,10,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fcrews were sent to the blaze at the    
OL,12,Fdetached bungalow in Banksburn Close at
OL,13,Fabout 07:30 GMT on Wednesday, following
OL,14,Fa 999 call from a carer.               
OL,16,FFour firefighters entered the property 
OL,17,Fand found the man, believed to be in   
OL,18,Fhis 80s, was already dead. No-one else 
OL,19,Fwas at the address.                    
OL,21,FThe fire service said its thoughts were
OL,22,Fwith the man's family and friends.     
